 realt\u00e0 virtuale, un'avvincente narrativa che tratta il tema del caporalato. Avrai a disposizione un mazzo di carte per sconfiggere la mafia, ogni carta porter\u00e0 conseguenza positive o negative in tutta la citt\u00e0. Fai la tua scelta e gioca la tua carta!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Carta_Nostra_Logo_1440_Transparent.png", "id": "7043425425741004", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974482_7043425432407670_5671989590901130667_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=U5qTy4a3bFIQ7kNvwEnTafB&_nc_oc=Adp9txf0ColWCADAe9IO-Xad1zl46F8WGyb9RzRFxveHLZAhzbWZll7z8uessvlTTXU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQDXR9QhmBH98Xkl7prszp45cwyUB3vSFywkuh0gM0-TQ&oe=6B047710"}, {"file_name": "CartaNostra_Logo02.png", "id": "2827330754076823", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003251_2827330757410156_6515219377821251284_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FlOM6X2LrFIQ7kNvwEWde50&_nc_oc=AdqIZdoqDWh76airmFGpw0ejy0d6VD9VGmEqXNyCET31eXAlErjSO6TE9CjtijW0_fs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQqiqxXQ1Yi0_O77MoCm7ZV-3tnLgeoB423sCeN6dFFoQ&oe=6B048604"}, {"file_name": "Carta_Nostra_Square_1440-1440.png", "id": "1149684542675806", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974692_1149684546009139_7602248288164393664_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mhHPRVylrKwQ7kNvwHFDkxq&_nc_oc=AdrXH42BpPTCCAbuPfnJp44rCodSdoEJc4bzzimUXHAS0B2LRjR99wMLPGFJqj0BGz8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTzVP9bAAwjPBrl5QoSf-9NbqEj9XZmqo5IbZewyFhb0A&oe=6B046870"}, {"file_name": "PDPART02.png", "id": "1140322596965596", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/390315